  "slug": "gex",
  "title_en": "Understanding Gamma Exposure (GEX): Shock Absorber or Amplifier?",
  "excerpt_en": "Net dealer gamma decides whether hedging dampens or amplifies volatility—and where the Gamma Flip sits.",
  "body_en": "<!-- ===== OptionsAji 博客片段：Gamma 敞口（GEX）使用说明 ===== -->\n<style>\n  .aji-guide{--bg:#f5f2f0;--ink:#151617;--gold:#c9a227;--card:#fffdfb;--line:#e7e1d8;--muted:#6f6a63;--soft:#c9c2b6;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;padding:4px}\n  .aji-guide h2{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2px}\n  .aji-guide h3{font-size:18px;margin:26px 0 8px;font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide p{margin:10px 0}.aji-guide .lead{font-size:17px}\n  .aji-guide .accent{color:var(--gold);font-weight:700}\n  .aji-guide .chart-card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 22px;margin:22px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(21,22,23,.05)}\n  .aji-guide .chart-note{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 14px}\n  .aji-guide canvas{max-width:100%}\n  .aji-guide .analogy{border-left:4px solid var(--gold);background:rgba(201,162,39,.07);padding:12px 16px;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;margin:16px 0}\n  .aji-guide .formula{background:#151617;color:#f5f2f0;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;overflow-x:auto}\n  .aji-guide .formula b{color:var(--gold)}\n  .aji-guide .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin:14px 0}\n  .aji-guide .cell{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 16px;background:var(--card)}\n  .aji-guide .cell h4{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:14.5px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:10px}\n  .aji-guide .data-table th{background:var(--ink);color:#f5f2f0;text-align:left;padding:11px 14px;font-weight:600}\n  .aji-guide .data-table td{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}\n  .aji-guide .data-table tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(201,162,39,.035)}\n  .aji-guide .data-table .col{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}\n  .aji-guide .tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px}\n  .aji-guide .tag-core{background:var(--gold);color:#fff}.aji-guide .tag-base{background:var(--soft);color:var(--ink)}\n  .aji-guide .disclaimer{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:26px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n  @media(max-width:520px){.aji-guide .grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n  .aji-guide .cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--gold);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:11px 20px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(201,162,39,.3);transition:background .15s}\n  .aji-guide .cta:hover{background:#b8911f}\n  .aji-guide .cta-row{margin:16px 0 4px}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom{background:rgba(201,162,39,.08);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:24px 0 8px;text-align:center}\n  .aji-guide .cta-bottom p{margin:0 0 10px;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"aji-guide\">\n  <h2>Understanding Gamma Exposure (GEX): Shock Absorber or Amplifier?</h2>\n  <p class=\"lead\">GEX measures <span class=\"accent\">dealers' net gamma</span>. It answers a big question: when price moves, does hedging <b>dampen</b> volatility (positive GEX, calmer tape) or <b>amplify</b> it (negative GEX, jumpier tape)? The switch between the two is the critical <b>Gamma Flip</b>.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-row\"><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/gex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live GEX board →</a></div>\n  <h3>1. Positive vs Negative GEX: Two Different Markets</h3>\n  <div class=\"analogy\"><p style=\"margin:4px 0\">Dealers hedge to stay neutral; direction depends on net gamma sign:</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>Positive GEX (shock absorber)</b>: sell rips, buy dips → pulls price back → volatility <span class=\"accent\">compressed</span>, sticky range.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:4px 0\"><b>Negative GEX (amplifier)</b>: buy rips, sell dips → pushes trend → volatility <span class=\"accent\">amplified</span>, one-way moves.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"formula\">Strike GEX ≈ dealer net <b>Gamma</b> × OI × 100 × spot² (sign by Call/Put, then sum)<br><b>Gamma Flip</b> = price where cumulative net GEX turns negative — the volatility regime switch</div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">GEX by Strike: Find Flip &amp; Gamma Walls (example)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Gold = positive GEX (dampening); gray = negative GEX (amplifying). Vertical lines mark spot and Gamma Flip. Rendered with Chart.js via jsDelivr CDN only.</p><canvas id=\"gexBars\" width=\"640\" height=\"320\" aria-label=\"GEX by strike\"></canvas></div>\n  <p>Above Flip, positive GEX tends to mean-revert; below Flip, dealers flip from stabilizer to accelerator. <span class=\"accent\">The tallest positive bar (e.g. $104) is the positive gamma wall</span>—often resistance/magnet.</p>\n  <h3>2. Same Symbol, Two Paths</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid2\"><div class=\"cell\"><h4>🟡 Above Flip · Positive GEX</h4>Low vol, mean-reversion; sharp moves get hedged flat—range/seller mindset.</div>\n  <div class=\"cell\"><h4>⚫ Below Flip · Negative GEX</h4>High vol, trend acceleration; breaks can cascade—watch leverage.</div></div>\n  <div class=\"chart-card\"><h2 style=\"font-size:18px\">Positive GEX (calm) vs Negative GEX (wild)</h2><p class=\"chart-note\">Gold = tight range; gray = amplified swings. Illustrative only.</p><canvas id=\"gexRegime\" width=\"640\" height=\"280\" aria-label=\"Vol regime comparison\"></canvas></div>\n  <h3>3. Key Readings</h3>\n  <table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Meaning</th><th>How to use</th></tr></thead><tbody>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Net GEX <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Aggregate dealer gamma exposure.</td><td>Positive = calmer; negative = jumpier.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Gamma Flip <span class=\"tag tag-core\">Core</span></td><td>Price where net GEX flips sign.</td><td><span class=\"accent\">Key vol boundary</span>; breaks matter.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Positive Gamma Wall</td><td>Highest positive-GEX strike.</td><td>Upside resistance/magnet.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Negative Gamma Zone</td><td>Below Flip.</td><td>Vol expansion; risk up.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Spot vs Flip</td><td>Current price vs Flip.</td><td>Above = dampening; below = amplifying.</td></tr>\n  <tr><td class=\"col\">Expiry Mix <span class=\"tag tag-base\">Aux</span></td><td>Which expiries hold GEX.</td><td>Structure shifts around OpEx.</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n  <h3>4. Three Reminders</h3>\n  <p><b>1. GEX is regime, not direction.</b> It tells you chop vs trend; direction needs price and other evidence.<br><b>2. Flip moves daily.</b> Update dynamically.<br><b>3. OpEx often resets the regime.</b> Gamma rolls off; don't trade yesterday's map.</p>\n  <div class=\"cta-bottom\"><p>Ready to explore? See today's live data 👇</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"https://www.options-aji.com/options/gex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">📊 Open live GEX board →</a></div><p class=\"disclaimer\">Data may be delayed ~15 minutes. For research only—not investment advice. Options trading involves substantial risk of loss. © OptionsAji</p>\n\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  if(typeof Chart==='undefined')return;\n  var GOLD='#c9a227',GOLD_SOFT='rgba(201,162,39,.85)',GRAY='#c9c2b6',INK='#151617';\n  var strikes=['90','92','94','96','98','100','102','104','106','108','110'];\n  var gex=[-1.2,-1.8,-2.5,-1.5,-0.3,1.0,2.8,3.5,2.0,1.1,0.6];\n  var spotLabel='100', flipBetween=['98','100']; // flip 约在 99\n\n  var markLines={id:'gexMarks',afterDatasetsDraw:function(chart){\n    var meta=chart.getDatasetMeta(0); if(!meta||!meta.data.length)return;\n    var ctx=chart.ctx, top=chart.chartArea.top, bot=chart.chartArea.bottom;\n    function xAt(label){var i=strikes.indexOf(label);return i>=0&&meta.data[i]?meta.data[i].x:null;}\n    var xSpot=xAt(spotLabel);\n    var a=xAt(flipBetween[0]),b=xAt(flipBetween[1]);var xFlip=(a!=null&&b!=null)?(a+b)/2:null;\n    function draw(x,color,text,dash){\n      if(x==null)return;ctx.save();ctx.strokeStyle=color;ctx.lineWidth=2;ctx.setLineDash(dash||[]);\n      ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(x,top);ctx.lineTo(x,bot);ctx.stroke();\n      ctx.setLineDash([]);ctx.fillStyle=color;ctx.font='700 12px -apple-system,sans-serif';ctx.textAlign='center';\n      ctx.fillText(text,x,top-4);ctx.restore();\n    }\n    draw(xFlip,INK,'Gamma Flip ≈ $99',[5,4]);\n    draw(xSpot,GOLD,'Spot $100',[]);\n  }};\n\n  var c1=document.getElementById('gexBars');\n  if(c1){new Chart(c1,{type:'bar',data:{labels:strikes,datasets:[{label:'Net GEX ($bn/1%)',data:gex,\n      backgroundColor:gex.map(function(v){return v>=0?GOLD_SOFT:GRAY;}),borderRadius:3}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,layout:{padding:{top:22}},plugins:{legend:{display:false},\n      tooltip:{callbacks:{title:function(t){return 'Strike $'+t[0].label;},label:function(i){return 'Net GEX '+i.parsed.y+(i.parsed.y>=0?' (positive·dampening)':' (negative·amplifying)');}}}},\n      scales:{x:{title:{display:true,text:'Strike',color:INK},ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},\n        y:{title:{display:true,text:'Net GEX',color:INK},ticks:{color:INK},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}},plugins:[markLines]});}\n\n  var t=['','','','','','','','','',''];\n  var calm=[100,100.6,99.7,100.3,99.8,100.2,99.9,100.1,100.0,100.05];\n  var wild=[100,99.2,100.4,98.3,99.1,96.8,97.9,95.0,96.2,93.5];\n  var c2=document.getElementById('gexRegime');\n  if(c2){new Chart(c2,{type:'line',data:{labels:t,datasets:[\n      {label:'Positive GEX: tight range',data:calm,borderColor:GOLD,tension:.35,pointRadius:0,borderWidth:2.5},\n      {label:'Negative GEX: amplified swings',data:wild,borderColor:GRAY,tension:.35,pointRadius:0,borderWidth:2.5}]},\n    options:{responsive:true,plugins:{legend:{labels:{color:INK,font:{size:13}}},tooltip:{enabled:false}},\n      scales:{x:{ticks:{color:INK},grid:{display:false}},y:{ticks:{color:INK,callback:function(v){return '$'+v;}},grid:{color:'rgba(21,22,23,.06)'}}}}});}\n})();\n</script>\n<!-- ===== /片段结束 ===== -->"
}
